# shell: both
# CW-042/FS-009: two items the menus offered and enabled, and that nothing
# carried out -- picked, they did nothing at all.  Both shells now, because
# both reach the same command layer.
wait 6
note Create link makes a link beside the item, named after it
click-row 1
wait 3
press-row 1 3
wait 2
release-row 1 3
wait 5
menu-pick Create link
wait 3
menu-pick Current folder
wait 30
expect-link /tmp/trk_script/a.txt link /tmp/trk_script/a.txt
note Identify re-asks what a thing IS.  The type table is read at startup,
note so a file whose type the table learned since then is still listed under
note the old one until something goes back and looks.
click-row 1
wait 2
click-row 2 1 ctrl
wait 2
press-row 2 3
wait 2
release-row 2 3
wait 5
menu-pick Identify
wait 8
expect-status identified 2 items
quit
